{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04492","headline":"入东阳峡与李明府舟前後不相及 · 陈子昂","name":"入东阳峡与李明府舟前後不相及","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东岩初解缆，南浦遂离羣。\n出没同洲岛，沿洄异渚濆。\n风烟犹可望，歌笑浩难闻。\n路转青山合，峰廻白日曛。\n奔涛上漫漫，积水下沄沄。\n倏忽犹疑及，差池复两分。\n离离间远树，蔼蔼没遥氛。\n地上巴陵道，星连牛斗文。\n孤狖啼寒月，哀鸿呌断云。\n仙舟不可见，摇思坐氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}